i don't want your pity i want change  jacob blake's sister  speaks out after her brother was shot in  the back  multiple times by police in kenosha  wisconsin on sunday  so many people have reached out to me  telling me  they're sorry that this happened to my  family  well don't be sorry because this has  been happening to my family  for a long time longer than i can  account for  on tuesday lotra widman delivered a  powerful message  demanding change it happened  to emmett till emmett till is my family  philando mike brown sandra  this has been happening to my family and  i've shared cheers for every single one  of these people that it's happened to  shortly after the moving speech celebs  weighed in  gabrielle union retweeting the clip and  asking fans to please watch  and listen i'm not sad  i'm not sorry i'm angry  and i'm tired i haven't cried one  time i stopped crying years ago  i am numb i have been watching police  murder people that look like me for  years  graphic video footage of the incident  shows 29 year old blake  who was reportedly trying to break up a  fight when police arrived on the scene  walking away from officers before being  shot in the back  blake was transported to a hospital in  milwaukee  in serious condition and the officers on  the scene were later placed on  administrative leave  the news has sparked protests all across  the country  and stars have been vocal about the  police shooting on social media  beyonce shared this pic of blake with  his children on instagram wednesday  writing sending prayers and thoughts to  jacob blake and his family  kevin hart tweeted in part quote another  black man shot multiple times by police  officers  it's shoot first and detained second in  these streets  lebron james echoed that sentiment  writing this  is so wrong and so sad feels so sorry  for him  his family and our people we want  justice  camila cabello shared the family pick of  blake on instagram  writing that she has no words demi  lovato called on fans to demand  justice while aisha tyler summed it all  up on twitter  writing he was trying to break up a  fight he wasn't  armed he was relieved police had arrived  to handle the fight so he went to get in  his car  and drive his children safely home they  shot him seven  times in the back in front of his  children say his name  jacob blake  you
 

